#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**YunoHost** is a system that installs itself on a **server**  \n"
"and allows you to install and maintain - **with very little technical "
"knowledge** -  \n"
"digital services (apps) **that you control**."
msgstr ""
"**YunoHost** d anagraw yettusbedden ɣef **uqeddac**  \n"
"yerna yettaǧǧa-k ad tesbeddeḍ yernu ad tessefrekeḍ - **s tmusni tatiknikit "
"drusit mliḥ** -  \n"
"imeẓla imḍinen (isnasen) **i tḥekkmeḍ s timmad-ik**."

