msgid "Donate to YunoHost!"
msgstr "Mudd tawsa i YunoHost!"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"YunoHost has been around **since 2012** and is essentially developed **on a "
"voluntary basis** and **outside the commercial sector**."
msgstr ""
"YunoHost yella-d **seg 2012** yerna yettwasnefli-d s wudem agejdan **s "
"lebɣi** yerna **beṛṛa i taɣult tnezzut**."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"YunoHost is a modest project in terms of the resources it mobilizes - yet an "
"ambitious one, as much for its activism as for its technical and interface "
"design, as well as for the required perseverance to package and maintain the "
"hundreds of applications in our catalog."
msgstr ""
"YunoHost d asenfar amecṭuḥ ɣef leḥsab n tiɣbula i yesseqdac - maca meqqeṛ "
"yiswi-s, ama ɣef tmennuɣt-is neɣ ɣef usufeɣ atiknik d ugrudem-is, akked "
"teṣbeṛt i d-yettwasutren i usekmem d usefrek n timaḍin n yisnasen deg ukalag-"
"nneɣ."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"If, like us, you'd like to see the project **continue to function**, evolve "
"to **meet its promises**, and allow us to **take care of the community**, "
"this is where you can donate!"
msgstr ""
"Ma yella, am nekkni, tebɣiḍ ad twaliḍ asenfar-a **ikemmel iteddu**, yettali "
"akken **ad yaweḍ ɣer leɛhud-is**, yerna ad aɣ-yeǧǧ **ad nḥader tamɣiwent**, "
"dagi i tzemreḍ ad tmuddeḍ tawsa!"

msgid "I want to give to YunoHost:"
msgstr "Bɣiɣ ad muddeɣ tawsa i YunoHost:"

