msgstr ""
"Ma yella tettmudduḍ yakan tawsa, tzemreḍ ad tbeddleḍ azal-is s usiti da!"

msgid "Why support YunoHost in 2026?"
msgstr "Acuɣer ara nɛawen YunoHost deg 2026?"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"YunoHost is a non-profit project that advocates a decentralized Internet, "
"with open, interoperable and sober technologies that respect privacy and "
"(re-)empower the greatest number of people and collectives."
msgstr ""
"YunoHost d asenfar ur nettnadi ara rrbeḥ, yettdef Internet ur nelli d "
"alemmas, s titiknulujiyin tilelliyin, timeṣdiyin yerna d timsuṛaf i iḥerrzen "
"tameddurt tusligt, akken ad d-yerr tazmert i umur ameqqran n yimdanen d "
"tegrawin."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Phase 1. Preserving the basics"
msgstr "Aḥric 1. Aḥraz n lsas"

#, fuzzy
msgid "1.1. Sustain its infrastructure and the team's work dynamics"
msgstr "1.1. Aseḥbiber ɣef tseddast-is d umussu n umahil n terbaɛt"

msgid "8,000 €"
msgstr "8,000 €"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Donations are used to pay for the infrastructure costs (YunoHost services "
"and task automation) and to allow the team to meet 2 to 3 times a year."
