"Tiwsiwin ttwasseqdacent i uxelleṣ n tesreftin n tseddast (imeẓla n YunoHost "
"d tawurmant n tmahilin) akken ad teǧǧ tarbaɛt ad temlil 2 neɣ 3 n tikkal deg "
"useggas."

#, fuzzy
msgid "1.2. Facilitate the collective and its projects"
msgstr "1.2. Aseffses n tegrawt d yisenfaren-is"

msgid "12,000 €"
msgstr "12.000 €"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Since 2024, a facilitator (known as “stirring officer”) is in charge to take "
"care of the collective both humanly and administratively, as well as in its "
"external relations."
msgstr ""
"Seg 2024, amseffses (yettwassen s yisem n “stirring officer”) yettwekkel ad "
