msgid "What are your donations used for?"
msgstr "D acu i nxeddem s tukciwin-nwen?"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Your donations guarantee our independence: they keep accounting for the "
"biggest share of our income until now."
msgstr ""
"Tiwsiwin-ik ḍemnent tilelli-nneɣ: mazal-itent ṭṭfent amur ameqqran n tirmas-"
"nneɣ ar tura."

msgid "Expenses"
msgstr "Aṣeṛṛef"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Our expected budget for 2026-2027 reaches 100 000 € and breaks down in 5 "
"categories."
msgstr ""
"Timsalt i nettraǧu i 2026-2027 tewweḍ 100 000 € yerna tebḍa ɣef 5 n taggayin."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Project expenditure breaks down into the following categories:"
msgstr "Tisreftin n usenfar bḍant ɣef taggayin-a:"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Development**: one-off funding awarded to some of the most work-intensive "
"features of [the roadmap](#roadmap) which require to ensure dedication over "
"the long-term of experienced contributors. It should be noted, however, that "
"this amount is negligible in relation to the voluntary work carried out by "
"the contributors overall - YunoHost remains primarily a volunteer-based "
"project."
msgstr ""
"**Anegmu**: asellek asuf yettwamudden i kra n tmahilin yesran amahil meqqren "
"deg [uɣawas n ubrid](#roadmap) yesran aḍman n uttekki deg lweqt aɣezzfan n "
"yimttekkiyen yesɛan tarmit. Ilaq ad d-nbder, ɣas akken, d akken azal-a drus "
"mliḥ ɣer yidis n umahil s lebɣi i gan yimttekkiyen s umata - YunoHost yeqqim "
"d asenfar yebnan s talɣa tamezwarut ɣef yimuranen."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Infrastructure**: corresponds to the hosting of the tools used by the "
"project, such as the website, documentation, forum, technical tools, etc. "
"The amount of this expenditure should reduce in 2025 following a migration "
"to a dedicated server from a friendly host provider."
msgstr ""
"**Taseddast**: teqqen ɣer usnegbi n yifecka yesseqdac usenfar, am usmel web, "
"tasemlit, amslay, ifecka itiknikiyen, atg. Azal n tesreft-a ilaq ad yenqes "
"deg 2025 s deffir unekcum ɣer uqeddac uzzig seg yimesdur amidaw."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Events**: expenses to enable the team to attend public events (e.g. JdLL) "
"and to meet in the same place at least twice a year to work together on "
"feature design and development strategy."
msgstr ""
"**Tedyunin**: tisreftin iwakken tarbaɛt ad tezmer ad tettekki deg tedyunin "
"tizayezin (amdya: JdLL) yernu ad temlil deg yiwen umkan ma drus snat n "
"tikkal deg useggas iwakken ad xedmen ddukkli ɣef usufeɣ n tmahilin d "
"tsedmirt n unegmu."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Facilitation**: financial compensation allocated to administrative tasks, "
"animation and coordination of the collective. This is a new type of expense "
"introduced in 2025, decided by the collective given the need to have a "
"person dedicated to these aspects (a.k.a “stirrer”)."
msgstr ""
"**Aseffses**: amxelleṣ n tedrimt yettwaheggan i tmahilin tideblanin, aselḥu "
"d umyellel n tegrawt. D taggayt tamaynut n tesreft i d-yennulfan deg 2025, i "
"teɣtes tegrawt imi tesra amdan uzzig i tisekkiwin-a (yettwassen s yisem n "
"“stirrer”)."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"**Fees and other expenses**: bank charges or donations made to other "
"collectives that support the project in kind."
msgstr ""
"**Iqaḍiyen d tesreftin nniḍen**: iqaḍiyen n lbanka neɣ tiwsiwin yettwamudden "
"i tegrawin nniḍen i yefkan tallalt s sselɛa i usenfar."

#, fuzzy
msgid "Revenues"
msgstr "Tirmas"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"YunoHost has been always able to rely on donations to fund its activity, "
"together with occasional grants. Given the increased funding needs for this "
"new season, the team has been looking for ways to lower the financial burden "
"on the community by:"
msgstr ""
"YunoHost yezga yezmer ad yetkel ɣef twisiwin i usellem n urmud-is, akked "
"tsleka n tikwal. Imi d-yella usuter meqqren n tedrimt i tallit-a tamaynut, "
"tarbaɛt tettnadi iberdan i usenqes n taɛkemt n tedrimt ɣef tmɣiwent s:"

#, fuzzy
msgid "Applying for grants (with some success this year),"
msgstr "Usuter n tsleka (s kra n umureḥ useggas-a),"

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Trying to partner with civil society organizations through a dedicated "
"project (with a lot of sweat but no financial success for now)."
msgstr ""
"Uɛraḍ n umyizan d tuddsiwin n tmetti taɣarimt s usenfar uzzig (s waṭas n "
"tidi maca mebla umureḥ n tedrimt ar tura)."

#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Starting to develop [a professional activity](https://yunohost.pro) which "
"aims at allowing some core contributors of the project's team to spend more "
"time on the project (some of it being paid by customers)."
msgstr ""
"Asebded n usnegmu n [urmud azzulan](https://yunohost.pro) yeswan ad yeǧǧ kra "
"n yimttekkiyen igejdanen deg terbaɛt n usenfar ad seddin ugar n wakud deg "
"usenfar (kra seg-s yettwaxelleṣ sɣur yimsaɣen)."

